# Atomic Component Placement

Use atomic design folders whenever creating or moving UI components.

- New presentational primitives go to `*/components/atoms/`.
- New composed blocks that aggregate atoms go to `*/components/organisms/`.
- Do not create flat `components/*.tsx` files for new UI components.
- Keep app-specific providers separate from atomic layers (`*/components/providers/`).
- In `packages/ui-kit`, preserve this structure:
  - `src/components/atoms/*`
  - `src/components/organisms/*`

If a component is not clearly an atom or organism, decide explicitly in code review comments and place it in one of those folders anyway (no "misc" buckets).
